{"seq":21,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-full-no-effort-high-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r5","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T22:09:19.446Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f1ea9bea71512dc6074c9268f95463e9425aacaf724bfc17fd1fea8c1441011c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Here's what I found: one ticket that's clearly Marrow Fieldworks, two that are very likely it, and one that might be.\n\n**Named as Marrow Fieldworks**\n- **PD-5302**: #central-random, Hollis on Oct 14. It's a follow-up from this week, and he said no action is needed.\n\n**Very likely Marrow Fieldworks (from Moss's notes)**\n- **#4409**: a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, 06:00 flatbed intake).\n- **#4412**: a small glitch in the driver text prompt when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots.\n- Both come from Moss's \"Central handoffs next week\" digest (Jan 2, 2026). It says Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on Jan 5. It lists these as open tickets Hollis flagged on \"Pree's dealer account\" before that handoff, but it never names the account outright.\n\n**Might be Marrow Fieldworks**\n- **#8841**: #central-random, Tobias on Oct 13. It's about the West yard Door 2 double-booking when flatbeds check in early. Tobias called it his \"dealer account\" (Plains depots, tractor-bay alerts). If Marrow Fieldworks went to Tobias in that January handoff, this is probably it, but nothing I can see confirms that.\n\n**Left out because they're for Marrow Agrisupply, a different account**\n- PD-4821 (#central-team, June 9)\n- FR-882, a feature request (same Moss digest)\n\nTwo things to know:\n- I couldn't find any account files for Marrow Fieldworks to check these against.\n- I took \"this week's chat\" to mean #central-random, because #central-team has nothing from this week. If you meant a different chat, tell me which one and I'll look there."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
